<title>FRANCE: Yemen seeks 150,000 tonnes flour - European trade.</title>
<headline>Yemen seeks 150,000 tonnes flour - European trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemen has launched a May 13 import tender for 150,000 tonnes of soft wheat flour, European traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender calls for shipment between August and October and the flour is expected to come from the European Union, the U.S. or both, they said.</p>
